# Project Structure

Vite + React admin panel for the Binder multi-company platform. Consumes `binder_app_backend` (NestJS) at `VITE_API_URL`.

## Root Layout

```
binder_app_frontend/
├── src/                    # Application source (edit here)
├── dist/                   # Production build output — do not edit
├── public/                 # Static assets
├── .cursor/rules/          # Cursor agent rules
├── compose.yaml
├── Dockerfile
├── nginx.conf
├── index.html
├── vite.config.ts
├── .env.example
└── package.json
```

## Entry Points

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `index.html` | HTML shell; mounts `#root`; loads `src/main.tsx` |
| `src/main.tsx` | React root |
| `src/App.tsx` | Providers + `RouterProvider` |
| `src/routes/index.tsx` | `createBrowserRouter` route tree |

